[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17580.948, "timestamp": "04:53:00", "text": "嗯。它们真是太好吃了。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17585.19, "timestamp": "04:53:05", "text": "我挺享受的。嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17586.708, "timestamp": "04:53:06", "text": "因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17588.39, "timestamp": "04:53:08", "text": "他们相当不错。我不知道在哪里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17590.868, "timestamp": "04:53:10", "text": "他们走了。他们还在吗？我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17595.43, "timestamp": "04:53:15", "text": "我不知道，但我不可能拥有它们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17599.43, "timestamp": "04:53:19", "text": "我整整七年都不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17602.23, "timestamp": "04:53:22", "text": "我喜欢，我终于拿到手了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17608.948, "timestamp": "04:53:28", "text": "周围。嗯。在我家附近的商场里。嗯哼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17611.27, "timestamp": "04:53:31", "text": "我当时就想，我需要最大的那个，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17613.67, "timestamp": "04:53:33", "text": "请。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17617.43, "timestamp": "04:53:37", "text": "我拿到了，而且我顺利完成了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17618.948, "timestamp": "04:53:38", "text": "现在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17622.07, "timestamp": "04:53:42", "text": "我现在饿了。花了我，不，花了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17625.35, "timestamp": "04:53:45", "text": "对我来说，这真的花了我好长时间……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17627.59, "timestamp": "04:53:47", "text": "整个过程只用了一个月就完成了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17630.47, "timestamp": "04:53:50", "text": "包。所以，我没吃多少东西。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17632.47, "timestamp": "04:53:52", "text": "这简直就像一次怀旧之旅。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17634.868, "timestamp": "04:53:54", "text": "我心想：“哦，我吃饱了，吃不下了。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17636.708, "timestamp": "04:53:56", "text": "它。”"}]